<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 1</span>: </span><span id="S4.T1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Ablation study on choice of similarity metric and aggregation functions for the Natural Question dataset. Higher numbers indicate stronger verification of the consistency hypothesis H1.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S4.F5" class="ltx_figure">
